/*!
@page saasservicemgmt-override-universe-domain How to Override the Default Universe Domain

In some cases, you may need to override the default universe domain used by the
client library. Use `AddUniverseDomainOption` when initializing the client
library to change this default.

<!-- inject-universe-domain-snippet-start -->
For example, this will override the default universe domain for `saasservicemgmt_v1::SaasDeploymentsClient`:

@snippet saas_deployments_client_samples.cc set-client-universe-domain

Follow these links to find examples for other \c *Client classes:

- [\c saasservicemgmt_v1::SaasDeploymentsClient](@ref saasservicemgmt_v1::SaasDeploymentsClient-universe-domain-snippet)
- [\c saasservicemgmt_v1::SaasRolloutsClient](@ref saasservicemgmt_v1::SaasRolloutsClient-universe-domain-snippet)

<!-- inject-universe-domain-snippet-end -->

*/

// <!-- inject-universe-domain-pages-start -->

